WEBVTT

00:00:26.270 --> 00:00:28.480
1st Striking Force, 3rd Section!

00:00:28.480 --> 00:00:29.550
Vanguard formation!

00:00:29.970 --> 00:00:30.990
Roger!

00:00:49.160 --> 00:00:50.570
Come on then, if you're coming!

00:01:03.890 --> 00:01:07.580
Port side! Multiple enemy PT boats 
approaching at high speed!

00:01:07.580 --> 00:01:08.800
Again?!

00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:11.660
All ships, intercept!

00:01:19.730 --> 00:01:21.350
I won't let you through!

00:01:31.440 --> 00:01:38.100
<b>See You Again on Another Quiet Blue Sea</b>

00:03:09.970 --> 00:03:11.670
They're being sent back 
to the docks, I heard.

00:03:11.670 --> 00:03:13.770
Well, it's hard to work 
them into the battle lines.

00:03:14.580 --> 00:03:16.020
What was that?!

00:03:16.020 --> 00:03:17.300
Yamashiro!

00:03:44.700 --> 00:03:48.290
<b>Night Battle in the Strait</b>

00:03:56.250 --> 00:03:57.080
Shigure!

00:03:57.960 --> 00:03:59.420
Gotcha!

00:04:04.120 --> 00:04:05.640
Damn it!

00:04:24.530 --> 00:04:27.360
Everyone, large enemy destroyers 
off the starboard side!

00:04:36.460 --> 00:04:39.600
Enemy changing course! 
They're firing torpedoes!

00:04:39.600 --> 00:04:41.210
Destroy Division 4, evasive maneuvers?!

00:04:41.490 --> 00:04:42.920
Seriously! Evade!

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.180
What? To our right?!

00:04:45.790 --> 00:04:46.870
Sister!

00:04:53.990 --> 00:04:55.100
Sister!

00:04:57.470 --> 00:04:58.260
Fusou!

00:04:58.260 --> 00:04:59.900
No enemy sighted!

00:04:58.260 --> 00:04:59.900
Where are you, Yamashiro?!

00:04:59.900 --> 00:05:00.560
Damn it!

00:05:02.020 --> 00:05:04.160
I'm fine, Yamashiro...

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:06.420
All ships, intercept!

00:05:05.210 --> 00:05:06.420
Sister...

00:05:06.420 --> 00:05:07.200
Yamashiro!

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:08.280
Damn you all!

00:05:18.570 --> 00:05:21.500
Fusou, here.

00:05:22.490 --> 00:05:24.790
Thank you, Shigure.

00:05:27.170 --> 00:05:30.290
We've got nowhere to hide out here...

00:05:30.290 --> 00:05:31.630
This is bad.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:34.070
Sister, um...

00:05:37.730 --> 00:05:39.460
I'm fine.

00:05:40.000 --> 00:05:43.860
It'd take more than that 
to sink a Fusou class!

00:05:44.790 --> 00:05:46.150
Let's move forward.

00:05:49.820 --> 00:05:51.320
Sister!

00:06:12.560 --> 00:06:16.090
Fleet, form up.

00:06:17.160 --> 00:06:18.900
We maintain course!

00:06:25.520 --> 00:06:27.980
<i>Y-Yamashiro!</i>

00:06:28.360 --> 00:06:30.540
Flagship Yamashiro at the head!

00:06:30.540 --> 00:06:32.740
Sister, behind me!

00:06:32.740 --> 00:06:36.800
Destroyer Division 4 and Shigure 
will protect our starboard.

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:38.950
Mogami, our port.

00:06:41.030 --> 00:06:42.100
Understood.

00:06:43.420 --> 00:06:44.520
Roger.

00:06:44.620 --> 00:06:45.870
Roger.

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:47.240
Roger that!

00:06:56.490 --> 00:06:58.650
Fleet, advance!

00:08:39.960 --> 00:08:44.320
This is hell.

00:09:02.480 --> 00:09:05.660
Multiple large enemy destroyers 
to our starboard!

00:09:05.660 --> 00:09:07.500
All ships, cannon and torpedo combat!

00:09:07.500 --> 00:09:08.160
Roger!

00:09:08.160 --> 00:09:08.810
On it!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:09.520
Okay!

00:09:08.810 --> 00:09:09.520
Roger!

00:09:10.320 --> 00:09:12.610
This direction, too! 11 o' clock!

00:09:20.410 --> 00:09:21.680
From behind, too?!

00:09:45.880 --> 00:09:47.010
Yamashiro!

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:49.240
All ships, increase speed! Evade!

00:09:52.680 --> 00:09:54.800
Multiple torpedoes from our 
starboard side to the rear!

00:09:54.800 --> 00:09:56.790
Starboard front, too!

00:09:58.370 --> 00:09:59.600
Sister!

00:09:59.600 --> 00:10:01.200
Yamashiro...

00:10:10.310 --> 00:10:11.750
Shigure...

00:10:19.370 --> 00:10:22.310
We have to move forward.

00:10:25.220 --> 00:10:28.480
Fleet, advance! Forward...

00:10:28.480 --> 00:10:29.740
Forward...

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:32.470
Forward!

00:10:34.810 --> 00:10:37.230
We're idiots, aren't we?

00:10:38.980 --> 00:10:40.200
What lies ahead of us is...

00:10:41.200 --> 00:10:43.790
... hell.

00:10:52.150 --> 00:10:54.050
Gunsmoke! 12 o' clock!

00:10:55.450 --> 00:10:56.410
Sister!

00:10:57.340 --> 00:10:59.680
Four enemy heavy cruisers sighted!

00:10:59.680 --> 00:11:02.370
Get the hell out of my way!

00:11:07.730 --> 00:11:09.040
Damn it!

00:11:10.310 --> 00:11:11.220
Oh, no!

00:11:11.220 --> 00:11:12.580
Huh? What?

00:11:19.610 --> 00:11:20.490
Yama-chan!

00:12:11.590 --> 00:12:12.820
Kept you waiting, huh?

00:12:13.490 --> 00:12:15.550
2nd Striking Force is here!

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:17.190
All ships, charge!

00:12:21.360 --> 00:12:23.390
Looks pretty bad.

00:12:23.390 --> 00:12:24.590
Don't worry, though.

00:12:26.390 --> 00:12:29.770
Battle, victory, is waiting for me!

00:12:30.500 --> 00:12:32.100
Oops!

00:12:33.980 --> 00:12:36.340
You like it rough, huh? Well, so do I!

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:44.070
Nice one.

00:12:44.720 --> 00:12:46.030
Of course.

00:12:46.400 --> 00:12:48.230
Torpedo Squadron 1, clean up!

00:12:48.230 --> 00:12:50.750
Torpedo Squadron 1 has 
reached the combat area.

00:12:50.750 --> 00:12:53.580
Now get to work, everyone!

00:12:57.750 --> 00:12:59.710
2nd Striking Force...

00:13:21.360 --> 00:13:24.700
Do what I tell you to, please!

00:13:29.690 --> 00:13:30.760
Yamashiro...

00:13:31.790 --> 00:13:33.790
They came...

00:13:33.790 --> 00:13:35.250
They came!

00:13:35.920 --> 00:13:37.480
Of course!

00:13:37.480 --> 00:13:41.010
Plan 2 was received successfully!

00:13:43.950 --> 00:13:45.550
Yamashiro, watch out!

00:14:06.000 --> 00:14:10.750
You're not making it through...

00:14:11.390 --> 00:14:15.880
We won't let you through!

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.730
What is that thing?

00:14:46.650 --> 00:14:48.740
This hell...

00:14:48.740 --> 00:14:51.320
This strait...

00:14:52.550 --> 00:14:58.560
...is your dead end!

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.070
Nachi!

00:15:04.070 --> 00:15:05.130
Damn it!

00:15:06.270 --> 00:15:07.370
Guys!

00:15:15.310 --> 00:15:16.390
Sister!

00:15:17.920 --> 00:15:19.070
Yamashiro!

00:15:42.400 --> 00:15:43.540
Three torpedoes left.

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:58.290
Mogami, thank you—

00:16:11.480 --> 00:16:13.990
1st Striking Force, 1st Section!

00:16:19.020 --> 00:16:23.860
Flagship Yamato has entered the combat area 
and will now assist our allied forces!

00:16:32.020 --> 00:16:33.760
Begin bombardment!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:47.120
Begin second bombardment!

00:16:48.720 --> 00:16:51.180
Torpedo Squadron 2, line ahead formation!

00:16:52.800 --> 00:16:55.700
Yahagi, sorry, but I'm going in first.

00:16:58.660 --> 00:17:01.600
Haruna, are you ready?

00:17:01.600 --> 00:17:05.290
2nd Section, Battleship Division 3, <i>charge</i>!

00:17:05.290 --> 00:17:07.590
Yes! Haruna is just fine!

00:17:17.310 --> 00:17:19.390
Torpedo Squadron 10, charge!

00:17:35.010 --> 00:17:37.710
Yamashiro-san, Fusou-san, thank you.

00:17:37.710 --> 00:17:40.230
It's thanks to you that we made it this far.

00:17:40.230 --> 00:17:41.620
No...

00:17:44.040 --> 00:17:45.960
Now, let's head to Leyte together—

00:17:48.100 --> 00:17:51.450
Never... Never!

00:18:12.210 --> 00:18:16.290
No... No... Sister!

00:18:16.290 --> 00:18:17.310
Now!

00:18:37.820 --> 00:18:40.640
Shigure, where are you?! Follow me!

00:18:41.710 --> 00:18:42.730
Yamashiro?

00:18:42.730 --> 00:18:44.170
Shigure, go!

00:18:44.170 --> 00:18:45.100
Okay!

00:18:55.190 --> 00:18:56.900
You're late, Shigure.

00:18:56.900 --> 00:18:58.080
Sorry, Yamashiro.

00:18:58.730 --> 00:19:02.120
Listen carefully. I'm getting 
in close. Back me up.

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:03.850
What was that?!

00:19:04.580 --> 00:19:05.710
Got it!

00:19:14.210 --> 00:19:15.160
What?

00:19:16.560 --> 00:19:19.590
Shigure, it's a vanguard with 
just the two of us, isn't it?

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:23.710
That's not a real formation.

00:19:24.840 --> 00:19:26.130
That's fine.

00:19:27.200 --> 00:19:28.200
Okay!

00:19:52.630 --> 00:19:57.260
You want to get sliced in two?!

00:20:19.080 --> 00:20:19.780
Shigure!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.980
Sink!

00:21:18.920 --> 00:21:20.980
Be still!

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:38.870
Sister...

00:21:41.440 --> 00:21:42.950
We'll always be...

00:23:29.130 --> 00:23:30.790
<b>Next Time</b>

00:23:34.760 --> 00:23:40.060
<b>Sasebo</b>

00:23:35.110 --> 00:23:38.560
Do I really belong here?
